msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"If you found this tutorial interesting, consider the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"Jika anda mendapati tutorial ini menarik, pertimbangkan yang berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replace the downloaded market data (`market_data.csv`) with your own returns and covariance estimates from real price history.\n"
msgstr "Gantikan data pasaran yang dimuat turun (`market_data.csv`) dengan anggaran pulangan dan kovarians anda sendiri daripada sejarah harga sebenar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Increase the number of QAOA layers, or train at 12–16 assets and transfer those angles, to push the hardware front closer to optimal.\n"
msgstr "Tambah bilangan lapisan QAOA, atau latih pada 12–16 aset dan pindahkan sudut tersebut, untuk menolak barisan hadapan perkakasan lebih hampir kepada optimum.\n"

